<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 958 in September.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 958 in September.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wage in the enterprise sector rose to 958 zlotys in September from 948 zlotys in August, and was 24.5-percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES     SEPTEMBER    AUGUST   SEPTEMBER 95</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN	958	 948	 769</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
